# | Moxa ioLogik E1214 Remote Ethernet I/O — 6 DIs + 6 Relays
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP (port 502); Modbus/TCP ID default = 1
# | 
# | DI channels (ch0-5):
# | FC02 addr 0-5: DI_status (R)
# | FC02 addr 1000-1005: DI_counterOverflowFlag (R)
# | FC01 addr 256-261: DI_counterStatus (R/W)
# | FC01 addr 272-277: DI_counterReset (R/W)
# | FC01 addr 288-293: DI_counterOverflowFlagClear (R/W)
# | FC04 addr 16-27 (2 words/ch, len 12): DI_counterValue u32 (R)
# | FC04 addr 48: DI-all_statusFromDI-00 (word, R)
# | Relay channels (ch0-5):
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E1214
@description=6-DI + 6-relay remote Ethernet I/O, Modbus/TCP. DI FC02: DI_status (0-5), DI_counterOverflowFlag (1000-1005). DI FC01: DI_counterStatus (256), DI_counterReset (272), DI_counterOverflowFlagClear (288). DI FC04: DI_counterValue u32 (addr 16-27 len 12). RLY FC01: RLY_status (0-5), RLY_pulseStatus (16-21), RLY_currentCountReset (48-53). FC03: RLY_all_status (32), RLY_pulseCount u32 hi/lo ch0-5 (36-47), RLY_pulseOnWidth unit 1.5s (52-57), RLY_pulseOffWidth unit 1.5s (68-73). FC04: RLY_TotalCount u32 (64-75), RLY_currentCount u32 (96-107).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-e1214.toml; Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
